I would like to thank my professor, Prof. Rico Steiner, for his continuous availability, guidance, and support throughout this Bachelor’s thesis. His advice, feedback, and willingness to discuss the challenges encountered during the project were particularly valuable.

I would also like to thank HOOC AG for welcoming us during this project and for taking the time to discuss potential features and improvements that could be integrated into the system. I would also like to thank them for providing the hardware used in the test bench, which made it possible to validate the solution in a realistic environment.

Finally, I would like to thank everyone who helped or advised me throughout this Bachelor’s thesis.
